    "title": "Bible Trivia - Word Quiz Game",
    "description": "Warning: Risk of getting addicted! Once you start beating levels, you won\u2019t be able to stop! In Bible Trivia you can study the holy book by level, and become knowledgeable Bible scholars as you play in a short time! Bible Trivia is made to test your knowledge of bible and learn more about Bible in a fun way. \r\n\r\nPlay Bible Free Trivia Game & Improve your knowledge about Bible's stories and peculiarities. Interesting and intelligent questions and answers will help you learn all the important facts about Christianity. If you like Bible game, this is a perfect past time app for you! \r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\u271d Tap the RIGHT answer button in the multiple choices;\r\n\u271d You need to catch the Right answer in 25 seconds; Can you ace it?\r\n\u271d There are 3 questions for each level, and a mysterious reward for you after the whole level is finished;\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u271d Over 5000 Bible related Questions.\r\n\u271d Easy and quick to play.\r\n\u271d Challenging and interesting.\r\n\u271d Best user interface.\r\n\u271d Daily rewards and free gift every day.\r\n\u271d A Bible quiz for adults and children alike.\r\n\u271d Play without internet connection.\r\n\u271d A comprehensive handbook to test your biblical knowledge.\r\n\u271d Quizzes about biblical stories, saints, and verses.\r\n\u271d Best Bible quiz app.\r\n\r\nPlay The MOST addictive Bible Trivia game! Just DOWNLOAD and try it NOW for FREE!\r\n\r\nGood Times!",
